00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:35.970 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En revanche, lors de la

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:37.204 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dernière élection, deux millions

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:38.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Québécois inscrits sur

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:39.640 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la listela listela listela lists

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:40.875 size:53% position:73% line:53%
voté. Certains par désintérêt;

00:00:38.773 --> 00:00:43.310 size:53% position:73% line:53%
