00:01:15.309 --> 00:01:18.679 size:53% position:73% line:53%
hors Québec cette année.

00:01:16.544 --> 00:01:19.914 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Parmi eux, ce camionneur longue

00:01:17.778 --> 00:01:21.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
distance qui travaille

00:01:19.013 --> 00:01:22.383 size:53% position:73% line:53%
